Smolder Cake was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as the first monster just having Candy. It had stats of 4G 2/5 with this until '''Beta 42.1''', where it gained +2G +2/+1 to end up at 6G 4/6. '''Beta 43.0''' gave it -1 ATK.

